    <briefdescription>
<para>This class acts as the glue that joins the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_combiner_helper" kindref="compound">CombinerHelper</ref> to the overall Combine algorithm. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_combiner_helper" kindref="compound">CombinerHelper</ref> is intended to report the modifications it makes to the MIR to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_g_i_sel_change_observer" kindref="compound">GISelChangeObserver</ref> and the observer subclass will act on these events. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
